senses.gloss:
अच्छिन्न + -पर्णः, -पत्रः [अच्छिन्नानि सततानि पर्णानि पत्राणि वा यस्य]
 N. of trees having constant leaves; particularly of the tree called शाखोटक;
 (of birds) having uncut or uninjured wings.

